## MLflow (experiment tracking)

Wrap a model fit or an evaluation in `{{project_name_py}}.tracking.tracked_run`;
it tags the run with the git commit and hashes of the pinned environment files.
Runs are stored in `mlruns/` (gitignored) unless `MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI` is set.
Results quoted in notes or reports cite the run id.

- `make mlflow-ui` — browse local runs
- `make mlflow-server` — a tracking server; set `MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI=http://host:port`
